            "type": "model",
            "used_in": "hazard",
            "description": "River Flood Hazard Maps for Europe and the Mediterranean Basin produced by the European Commission Joint Research Centre (JRC) as part of the Copernicus Emergency Management Service. Generated using the LISFLOOD hydrological model for river flow simulation and the LISFLOOD-FP hydrodynamic model for inundation extent. Covers river basins exceeding 150 km2 across geographical Europe plus basins draining to the Mediterranean and Black Seas. Nine return periods (10 to 500 years); cell values represent maximum water depth in metres."
          }
